('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','// [TOOL] V2: Authentication  V4: Access Control  V5: Validation','bash','["mTLS (Mutual TLS)","JSON Web Token (JWT)","OWASP Top 10","OWASP ASVS"]'::jsonb,'["mTLS (Mutual TLS)","JSON Web Token (JWT)","OWASP Top 10","OWASP ASVS"]'::jsonb,3,'OWASP ASVS (Security Verification Standard): Standar OWASP berisi daftar kontrol terverifikasi untuk merancang dan menguji keamanan aplikasi dari awal.','OWASP ASVS (Security Verification Standard): OWASP''s standard list of verifiable controls for designing and testing application security from the ground up.','Tools ini bernama OWASP ASVS, fungsinya: Standar OWASP berisi daftar kontrol terverifikasi untuk merancang dan menguji keamanan aplikasi dari awal.','This tool is called OWASP ASVS, and it: OWASP''s standard list of verifiable controls for designing and testing application security from the ground up.','Pilih level (1-3) sesuai risiko aplikasi, lalu jadikan daftar kontrolnya acuan arsitektur keamanan sejak desain.','Pick a level (1-3) matching the app''s risk, then use its control list as the security architecture reference from the design stage.','Merancang keamanan sejak hari pertama (secure by design) jauh lebih murah daripada menambalnya setelah insiden.','Designing security from day one (secure by design) is far cheaper than patching it after an incident.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah OWASP ASVS berikut:','Complete the following OWASP ASVS command:','// ASVS V2: Authentication  V4: Access Control  ____: Validation','bash','["V3","V9","V5","V12"]'::jsonb,'["V3","V9","V5","V12"]'::jsonb,2,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "V5". Pilih level (1-3) sesuai risiko aplikasi, lalu jadikan daftar kontrolnya acuan arsitektur keamanan sejak desain.','The missing part is "V5". Pick a level (1-3) matching the app''s risk, then use its control list as the security architecture reference from the design stage.','OWASP ASVS dipakai untuk: Standar OWASP berisi daftar kontrol terverifikasi untuk merancang dan menguji keamanan aplikasi dari awal.','OWASP ASVS is used to: OWASP''s standard list of verifiable controls for designing and testing application security from the ground up.','Pilih level (1-3) sesuai risiko aplikasi, lalu jadikan daftar kontrolnya acuan arsitektur keamanan sejak desain.','Pick a level (1-3) matching the app''s risk, then use its control list as the security architecture reference from the design stage.','Merancang keamanan sejak hari pertama (secure by design) jauh lebih murah daripada menambalnya setelah insiden.','Designing security from day one (secure by design) is far cheaper than patching it after an incident.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari OWASP ASVS?','What is OWASP ASVS used for?','// OWASP ASVS — Security Verification Standard','bash','["Standar OWASP berisi daftar kontrol terverifikasi untuk merancang dan menguji keamanan aplikasi dari awal.","Daftar 10 risiko keamanan aplikasi web paling kritis sebagai acuan prioritas pertahanan.","Metode merancang keamanan di tahap desain dengan mengenali 6 kategori ancaman sebelum kode ditulis.","Standar token bertanda tangan untuk membawa klaim identitas antara pihak secara ringkas dan terverifikasi."]'::jsonb,'["OWASP''s standard list of verifiable controls for designing and testing application security from the ground up.","A list of the 10 most critical web application security risks, used as a defense-priority reference.","A design-stage security method that identifies 6 threat categories before any code is written.","A signed token standard for compactly carrying verifiable identity claims between parties."]'::jsonb,0,'OWASP ASVS: Standar OWASP berisi daftar kontrol terverifikasi untuk merancang dan menguji keamanan aplikasi dari awal.','OWASP ASVS: OWASP''s standard list of verifiable controls for designing and testing application security from the ground up.','OWASP ASVS adalah kategori "Security Verification Standard".','OWASP ASVS falls under the "Security Verification Standard" category.','Pilih level (1-3) sesuai risiko aplikasi, lalu jadikan daftar kontrolnya acuan arsitektur keamanan sejak desain.','Pick a level (1-3) matching the app''s risk, then use its control list as the security architecture reference from the design stage.','Merancang keamanan sejak hari pertama (secure by design) jauh lebih murah daripada menambalnya setelah insiden.','Designing security from day one (secure by design) is far cheaper than patching it after an incident.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','// A01 Broken Access Control  A02 Cryptographic Failures  A03 Injection','bash','["SIEM (Splunk/ELK)","JSON Web Token (JWT)","OWASP Top 10","Content Security Policy (CSP)"]'::jsonb,'["SIEM (Splunk/ELK)","JSON Web Token (JWT)","OWASP Top 10","Content Security Policy (CSP)"]'::jsonb,2,'OWASP Top 10 (Risk Awareness Standard): Daftar 10 risiko keamanan aplikasi web paling kritis sebagai acuan prioritas pertahanan.','OWASP Top 10 (Risk Awareness Standard): A list of the 10 most critical web application security risks, used as a defense-priority reference.','Tools ini bernama OWASP Top 10, fungsinya: Daftar 10 risiko keamanan aplikasi web paling kritis sebagai acuan prioritas pertahanan.','This tool is called OWASP Top 10, and it: A list of the 10 most critical web application security risks, used as a defense-priority reference.','Jadikan checklist wajib saat code review dan desain arsitektur: tiap item dicek apakah sudah dimitigasi.','Use it as a mandatory checklist during code review and architecture design, verifying each item is mitigated.','Broken Access Control konsisten jadi risiko #1 — selalu verifikasi otorisasi di SETIAP endpoint, bukan cuma login.','Broken Access Control consistently ranks #1 — always verify authorization on EVERY endpoint, not just at login.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah OWASP Top 10 berikut:','Complete the following OWASP Top 10 command:','// A01 Broken Access Control  A02 Cryptographic Failures  ____ Injection','bash','["A07","A09","A05","A03"]'::jsonb,'["A07","A09","A05","A03"]'::jsonb,3,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "A03". Jadikan checklist wajib saat code review dan desain arsitektur: tiap item dicek apakah sudah dimitigasi.','The missing part is "A03". Use it as a mandatory checklist during code review and architecture design, verifying each item is mitigated.','OWASP Top 10 dipakai untuk: Daftar 10 risiko keamanan aplikasi web paling kritis sebagai acuan prioritas pertahanan.','OWASP Top 10 is used to: A list of the 10 most critical web application security risks, used as a defense-priority reference.','Jadikan checklist wajib saat code review dan desain arsitektur: tiap item dicek apakah sudah dimitigasi.','Use it as a mandatory checklist during code review and architecture design, verifying each item is mitigated.','Broken Access Control konsisten jadi risiko #1 — selalu verifikasi otorisasi di SETIAP endpoint, bukan cuma login.','Broken Access Control consistently ranks #1 — always verify authorization on EVERY endpoint, not just at login.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari OWASP Top 10?','What is OWASP Top 10 used for?','// OWASP Top 10 — Risk Awareness Standard','bash','["Protokol standar untuk otorisasi delegasi (OAuth) dan autentikasi identitas (OIDC) antar aplikasi.","Lapisan filter di depan aplikasi web yang memblokir pola serangan umum (SQLi, XSS) sebelum sampai ke server.","Header HTTP yang membatasi sumber mana saja yang boleh memuat script/style di sebuah halaman.","Daftar 10 risiko keamanan aplikasi web paling kritis sebagai acuan prioritas pertahanan."]'::jsonb,'["The standard protocol for delegated authorization (OAuth) and identity authentication (OIDC) between apps.","A filtering layer in front of a web app that blocks common attack patterns (SQLi, XSS) before they reach the server.","An HTTP header that restricts which sources are allowed to load scripts/styles on a page.","A list of the 10 most critical web application security risks, used as a defense-priority reference."]'::jsonb,3,'OWASP Top 10: Daftar 10 risiko keamanan aplikasi web paling kritis sebagai acuan prioritas pertahanan.','OWASP Top 10: A list of the 10 most critical web application security risks, used as a defense-priority reference.','OWASP Top 10 adalah kategori "Risk Awareness Standard".','OWASP Top 10 falls under the "Risk Awareness Standard" category.','Jadikan checklist wajib saat code review dan desain arsitektur: tiap item dicek apakah sudah dimitigasi.','Use it as a mandatory checklist during code review and architecture design, verifying each item is mitigated.','Broken Access Control konsisten jadi risiko #1 — selalu verifikasi otorisasi di SETIAP endpoint, bukan cuma login.','Broken Access Control consistently ranks #1 — always verify authorization on EVERY endpoint, not just at login.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] default-src ''self''; script-src ''self'' trusted.cdn.com','bash','["mTLS (Mutual TLS)","Content Security Policy (CSP)","OWASP ASVS","Argon2id"]'::jsonb,'["mTLS (Mutual TLS)","Content Security Policy (CSP)","OWASP ASVS","Argon2id"]'::jsonb,1,'Content Security Policy (CSP) (Browser Security Header): Header HTTP yang membatasi sumber mana saja yang boleh memuat script/style di sebuah halaman.','Content Security Policy (CSP) (Browser Security Header): An HTTP header that restricts which sources are allowed to load scripts/styles on a page.','Tools ini bernama Content Security Policy (CSP), fungsinya: Header HTTP yang membatasi sumber mana saja yang boleh memuat script/style di sebuah halaman.','This tool is called Content Security Policy (CSP), and it: An HTTP header that restricts which sources are allowed to load scripts/styles on a page.','Tambahkan header ini di respons server dengan whitelist domain tepercaya untuk tiap jenis resource.','Add this header to the server response with a whitelist of trusted domains for each resource type.','CSP yang benar adalah pertahanan berlapis terkuat melawan XSS, bahkan jika ada celah injeksi lolos.','A properly set CSP is one of the strongest layered defenses against XSS, even if an injection flaw slips through.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah Content Security Policy (CSP) berikut:','Complete the following Content Security Policy (CSP) command:','Content-Security-Policy: default-src ''self''; ____ ''self'' trusted.cdn.com','bash','["script-src","allow-script","script-url","js-src-allow"]'::jsonb,'["script-src","allow-script","script-url","js-src-allow"]'::jsonb,0,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "script-src". Tambahkan header ini di respons server dengan whitelist domain tepercaya untuk tiap jenis resource.','The missing part is "script-src". Add this header to the server response with a whitelist of trusted domains for each resource type.','Content Security Policy (CSP) dipakai untuk: Header HTTP yang membatasi sumber mana saja yang boleh memuat script/style di sebuah halaman.','Content Security Policy (CSP) is used to: An HTTP header that restricts which sources are allowed to load scripts/styles on a page.','Tambahkan header ini di respons server dengan whitelist domain tepercaya untuk tiap jenis resource.','Add this header to the server response with a whitelist of trusted domains for each resource type.','CSP yang benar adalah pertahanan berlapis terkuat melawan XSS, bahkan jika ada celah injeksi lolos.','A properly set CSP is one of the strongest layered defenses against XSS, even if an injection flaw slips through.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari Content Security Policy (CSP)?','What is Content Security Policy (CSP) used for?','// Content Security Policy (CSP) — Browser Security Header','bash','["Metode merancang keamanan di tahap desain dengan mengenali 6 kategori ancaman sebelum kode ditulis.","Kedua pihak (klien dan server) saling memverifikasi sertifikat, bukan cuma server ke klien seperti TLS biasa.","Algoritma hashing password pemenang Password Hashing Competition, dirancang tahan GPU/ASIC cracking.","Header HTTP yang membatasi sumber mana saja yang boleh memuat script/style di sebuah halaman."]'::jsonb,'["A design-stage security method that identifies 6 threat categories before any code is written.","Both sides (client and server) verify each other''s certificates, unlike regular TLS where only the client verifies the server.","The Password Hashing Competition-winning algorithm, designed to resist GPU/ASIC cracking.","An HTTP header that restricts which sources are allowed to load scripts/styles on a page."]'::jsonb,3,'Content Security Policy (CSP): Header HTTP yang membatasi sumber mana saja yang boleh memuat script/style di sebuah halaman.','Content Security Policy (CSP): An HTTP header that restricts which sources are allowed to load scripts/styles on a page.','Content Security Policy (CSP) adalah kategori "Browser Security Header".','Content Security Policy (CSP) falls under the "Browser Security Header" category.','Tambahkan header ini di respons server dengan whitelist domain tepercaya untuk tiap jenis resource.','Add this header to the server response with a whitelist of trusted domains for each resource type.','CSP yang benar adalah pertahanan berlapis terkuat melawan XSS, bahkan jika ada celah injeksi lolos.','A properly set CSP is one of the strongest layered defenses against XSS, even if an injection flaw slips through.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] /authorize?response_type=code&client_id=app&code_challenge=xyz','bash','["Argon2id","OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect","STRIDE Threat Modeling","HSTS"]'::jsonb,'["Argon2id","OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect","STRIDE Threat Modeling","HSTS"]'::jsonb,1,'OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect (Auth Protocol): Protokol standar untuk otorisasi delegasi (OAuth) dan autentikasi identitas (OIDC) antar aplikasi.','OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect (Auth Protocol): The standard protocol for delegated authorization (OAuth) and identity authentication (OIDC) between apps.','Tools ini bernama OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect, fungsinya: Protokol standar untuk otorisasi delegasi (OAuth) dan autentikasi identitas (OIDC) antar aplikasi.','This tool is called OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect, and it: The standard protocol for delegated authorization (OAuth) and identity authentication (OIDC) between apps.','Gunakan Authorization Code flow dengan PKCE untuk aplikasi web/mobile, jangan Implicit flow yang sudah usang.','Use the Authorization Code flow with PKCE for web/mobile apps, not the deprecated Implicit flow.','PKCE mencegah pencurian authorization code di aplikasi mobile/SPA yang tidak bisa menyimpan client secret dengan aman.','PKCE prevents authorization-code theft in mobile/SPA apps that can''t safely store a client secret.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect berikut:','Complete the following OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect command:','GET /authorize?response_type=code&client_id=app&____=xyz','bash','["code_challenge","pkce_token","auth_hash","code_secret"]'::jsonb,'["code_challenge","pkce_token","auth_hash","code_secret"]'::jsonb,0,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "code_challenge". Gunakan Authorization Code flow dengan PKCE untuk aplikasi web/mobile, jangan Implicit flow yang sudah usang.','The missing part is "code_challenge". Use the Authorization Code flow with PKCE for web/mobile apps, not the deprecated Implicit flow.','OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect dipakai untuk: Protokol standar untuk otorisasi delegasi (OAuth) dan autentikasi identitas (OIDC) antar aplikasi.','OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect is used to: The standard protocol for delegated authorization (OAuth) and identity authentication (OIDC) between apps.','Gunakan Authorization Code flow dengan PKCE untuk aplikasi web/mobile, jangan Implicit flow yang sudah usang.','Use the Authorization Code flow with PKCE for web/mobile apps, not the deprecated Implicit flow.','PKCE mencegah pencurian authorization code di aplikasi mobile/SPA yang tidak bisa menyimpan client secret dengan aman.','PKCE prevents authorization-code theft in mobile/SPA apps that can''t safely store a client secret.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect?','What is OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect used for?','// OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect — Auth Protocol','bash','["Protokol standar untuk otorisasi delegasi (OAuth) dan autentikasi identitas (OIDC) antar aplikasi.","Mengumpulkan dan mengorelasikan log dari seluruh sistem untuk mendeteksi insiden keamanan secara terpusat.","Header yang memaksa browser selalu memakai HTTPS ke domain ini, mencegah downgrade ke HTTP.","Standar OWASP berisi daftar kontrol terverifikasi untuk merancang dan menguji keamanan aplikasi dari awal."]'::jsonb,'["The standard protocol for delegated authorization (OAuth) and identity authentication (OIDC) between apps.","Collects and correlates logs from every system to detect security incidents from a central place.","A header that forces browsers to always use HTTPS for this domain, preventing downgrade to HTTP.","OWASP''s standard list of verifiable controls for designing and testing application security from the ground up."]'::jsonb,0,'OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect: Protokol standar untuk otorisasi delegasi (OAuth) dan autentikasi identitas (OIDC) antar aplikasi.','OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect: The standard protocol for delegated authorization (OAuth) and identity authentication (OIDC) between apps.','OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect adalah kategori "Auth Protocol".','OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect falls under the "Auth Protocol" category.','Gunakan Authorization Code flow dengan PKCE untuk aplikasi web/mobile, jangan Implicit flow yang sudah usang.','Use the Authorization Code flow with PKCE for web/mobile apps, not the deprecated Implicit flow.','PKCE mencegah pencurian authorization code di aplikasi mobile/SPA yang tidak bisa menyimpan client secret dengan aman.','PKCE prevents authorization-code theft in mobile/SPA apps that can''t safely store a client secret.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] secret, { algorithms: [''HS256''] })','bash','["JSON Web Token (JWT)","HashiCorp Vault","OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect","Content Security Policy (CSP)"]'::jsonb,'["JSON Web Token (JWT)","HashiCorp Vault","OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect","Content Security Policy (CSP)"]'::jsonb,0,'JSON Web Token (JWT) (Auth Token Standard): Standar token bertanda tangan untuk membawa klaim identitas antara pihak secara ringkas dan terverifikasi.','JSON Web Token (JWT) (Auth Token Standard): A signed token standard for compactly carrying verifiable identity claims between parties.','Tools ini bernama JSON Web Token (JWT), fungsinya: Standar token bertanda tangan untuk membawa klaim identitas antara pihak secara ringkas dan terverifikasi.','This tool is called JSON Web Token (JWT), and it: A signed token standard for compactly carrying verifiable identity claims between parties.','Server menandatangani token dengan secret/private key; selalu verifikasi tanda tangan sebelum memercayai isinya.','The server signs the token with a secret/private key; always verify the signature before trusting its contents.','Jangan pernah menerima alg:''none'' dari token yang masuk — itu celah klasik yang memalsukan tanda tangan.','Never accept alg:''none'' from an incoming token — it''s a classic flaw that forges the signature.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah JSON Web Token (JWT) berikut:','Complete the following JSON Web Token (JWT) command:','jwt.verify(token, secret, { ____: [''HS256''] })','bash','["algorithm","signType","method","algorithms"]'::jsonb,'["algorithm","signType","method","algorithms"]'::jsonb,3,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "algorithms". Server menandatangani token dengan secret/private key; selalu verifikasi tanda tangan sebelum memercayai isinya.','The missing part is "algorithms". The server signs the token with a secret/private key; always verify the signature before trusting its contents.','JSON Web Token (JWT) dipakai untuk: Standar token bertanda tangan untuk membawa klaim identitas antara pihak secara ringkas dan terverifikasi.','JSON Web Token (JWT) is used to: A signed token standard for compactly carrying verifiable identity claims between parties.','Server menandatangani token dengan secret/private key; selalu verifikasi tanda tangan sebelum memercayai isinya.','The server signs the token with a secret/private key; always verify the signature before trusting its contents.','Jangan pernah menerima alg:''none'' dari token yang masuk — itu celah klasik yang memalsukan tanda tangan.','Never accept alg:''none'' from an incoming token — it''s a classic flaw that forges the signature.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari JSON Web Token (JWT)?','What is JSON Web Token (JWT) used for?','// JSON Web Token (JWT) — Auth Token Standard','bash','["Algoritma hashing password pemenang Password Hashing Competition, dirancang tahan GPU/ASIC cracking.","Kedua pihak (klien dan server) saling memverifikasi sertifikat, bukan cuma server ke klien seperti TLS biasa.","Standar OWASP berisi daftar kontrol terverifikasi untuk merancang dan menguji keamanan aplikasi dari awal.","Standar token bertanda tangan untuk membawa klaim identitas antara pihak secara ringkas dan terverifikasi."]'::jsonb,'["The Password Hashing Competition-winning algorithm, designed to resist GPU/ASIC cracking.","Both sides (client and server) verify each other''s certificates, unlike regular TLS where only the client verifies the server.","OWASP''s standard list of verifiable controls for designing and testing application security from the ground up.","A signed token standard for compactly carrying verifiable identity claims between parties."]'::jsonb,3,'JSON Web Token (JWT): Standar token bertanda tangan untuk membawa klaim identitas antara pihak secara ringkas dan terverifikasi.','JSON Web Token (JWT): A signed token standard for compactly carrying verifiable identity claims between parties.','JSON Web Token (JWT) adalah kategori "Auth Token Standard".','JSON Web Token (JWT) falls under the "Auth Token Standard" category.','Server menandatangani token dengan secret/private key; selalu verifikasi tanda tangan sebelum memercayai isinya.','The server signs the token with a secret/private key; always verify the signature before trusting its contents.','Jangan pernah menerima alg:''none'' dari token yang masuk — itu celah klasik yang memalsukan tanda tangan.','Never accept alg:''none'' from an incoming token — it''s a classic flaw that forges the signature.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains','bash','["JSON Web Token (JWT)","OWASP ASVS","Content Security Policy (CSP)","HSTS"]'::jsonb,'["JSON Web Token (JWT)","OWASP ASVS","Content Security Policy (CSP)","HSTS"]'::jsonb,3,'HSTS (Transport Security Header): Header yang memaksa browser selalu memakai HTTPS ke domain ini, mencegah downgrade ke HTTP.','HSTS (Transport Security Header): A header that forces browsers to always use HTTPS for this domain, preventing downgrade to HTTP.','Tools ini bernama HSTS, fungsinya: Header yang memaksa browser selalu memakai HTTPS ke domain ini, mencegah downgrade ke HTTP.','This tool is called HSTS, and it: A header that forces browsers to always use HTTPS for this domain, preventing downgrade to HTTP.','Tambahkan header ini di respons HTTPS dengan max-age cukup panjang agar perlindungan bertahan lama.','Add this header to the HTTPS response with a sufficiently long max-age so the protection persists.','Tanpa HSTS, serangan downgrade bisa memaksa korban kembali ke HTTP yang tidak terenkripsi.','Without HSTS, a downgrade attack can force a victim back onto unencrypted HTTP.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah HSTS berikut:','Complete the following HSTS command:','Strict-Transport-Security: ____=63072000; includeSubDomains','bash','["ttl","expire-after","max-age","valid-for"]'::jsonb,'["ttl","expire-after","max-age","valid-for"]'::jsonb,2,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "max-age". Tambahkan header ini di respons HTTPS dengan max-age cukup panjang agar perlindungan bertahan lama.','The missing part is "max-age". Add this header to the HTTPS response with a sufficiently long max-age so the protection persists.','HSTS dipakai untuk: Header yang memaksa browser selalu memakai HTTPS ke domain ini, mencegah downgrade ke HTTP.','HSTS is used to: A header that forces browsers to always use HTTPS for this domain, preventing downgrade to HTTP.','Tambahkan header ini di respons HTTPS dengan max-age cukup panjang agar perlindungan bertahan lama.','Add this header to the HTTPS response with a sufficiently long max-age so the protection persists.','Tanpa HSTS, serangan downgrade bisa memaksa korban kembali ke HTTP yang tidak terenkripsi.','Without HSTS, a downgrade attack can force a victim back onto unencrypted HTTP.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari HSTS?','What is HSTS used for?','// HSTS — Transport Security Header','bash','["Protokol standar untuk otorisasi delegasi (OAuth) dan autentikasi identitas (OIDC) antar aplikasi.","Standar token bertanda tangan untuk membawa klaim identitas antara pihak secara ringkas dan terverifikasi.","Menyimpan, mengenkripsi, dan mengatur akses ke secret (API key, password DB) secara terpusat dan terotorisasi.","Header yang memaksa browser selalu memakai HTTPS ke domain ini, mencegah downgrade ke HTTP."]'::jsonb,'["The standard protocol for delegated authorization (OAuth) and identity authentication (OIDC) between apps.","A signed token standard for compactly carrying verifiable identity claims between parties.","Centrally stores, encrypts, and governs access to secrets (API keys, DB passwords) with proper authorization.","A header that forces browsers to always use HTTPS for this domain, preventing downgrade to HTTP."]'::jsonb,3,'HSTS: Header yang memaksa browser selalu memakai HTTPS ke domain ini, mencegah downgrade ke HTTP.','HSTS: A header that forces browsers to always use HTTPS for this domain, preventing downgrade to HTTP.','HSTS adalah kategori "Transport Security Header".','HSTS falls under the "Transport Security Header" category.','Tambahkan header ini di respons HTTPS dengan max-age cukup panjang agar perlindungan bertahan lama.','Add this header to the HTTPS response with a sufficiently long max-age so the protection persists.','Tanpa HSTS, serangan downgrade bisa memaksa korban kembali ke HTTP yang tidak terenkripsi.','Without HSTS, a downgrade attack can force a victim back onto unencrypted HTTP.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] ARGS "@detectSQLi" "id:1001,deny,status:403"','bash','["OWASP ASVS","Web Application Firewall (WAF)","HSTS","SIEM (Splunk/ELK)"]'::jsonb,'["OWASP ASVS","Web Application Firewall (WAF)","HSTS","SIEM (Splunk/ELK)"]'::jsonb,1,'Web Application Firewall (WAF) (Perimeter Defense): Lapisan filter di depan aplikasi web yang memblokir pola serangan umum (SQLi, XSS) sebelum sampai ke server.','Web Application Firewall (WAF) (Perimeter Defense): A filtering layer in front of a web app that blocks common attack patterns (SQLi, XSS) before they reach the server.','Tools ini bernama Web Application Firewall (WAF), fungsinya: Lapisan filter di depan aplikasi web yang memblokir pola serangan umum (SQLi, XSS) sebelum sampai ke server.','This tool is called Web Application Firewall (WAF), and it: A filtering layer in front of a web app that blocks common attack patterns (SQLi, XSS) before they reach the server.','Pasang di depan aplikasi (mis. Cloudflare/ModSecurity), aktifkan ruleset OWASP Core Rule Set, lalu pantau false positive.','Deploy it in front of the app (e.g. Cloudflare/ModSecurity), enable the OWASP Core Rule Set, then monitor false positives.','WAF adalah lapisan tambahan, bukan pengganti validasi input yang benar di kode aplikasinya sendiri.','A WAF is an extra layer, not a replacement for proper input validation in the application code itself.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah Web Application Firewall (WAF) berikut:','Complete the following Web Application Firewall (WAF) command:','SecRule ARGS "____" "id:1001,deny,status:403"','bash','["@matchInjection","@filterSQL","@detectSQLi","@blockSQL"]'::jsonb,'["@matchInjection","@filterSQL","@detectSQLi","@blockSQL"]'::jsonb,2,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "@detectSQLi". Pasang di depan aplikasi (mis. Cloudflare/ModSecurity), aktifkan ruleset OWASP Core Rule Set, lalu pantau false positive.','The missing part is "@detectSQLi". Deploy it in front of the app (e.g. Cloudflare/ModSecurity), enable the OWASP Core Rule Set, then monitor false positives.','Web Application Firewall (WAF) dipakai untuk: Lapisan filter di depan aplikasi web yang memblokir pola serangan umum (SQLi, XSS) sebelum sampai ke server.','Web Application Firewall (WAF) is used to: A filtering layer in front of a web app that blocks common attack patterns (SQLi, XSS) before they reach the server.','Pasang di depan aplikasi (mis. Cloudflare/ModSecurity), aktifkan ruleset OWASP Core Rule Set, lalu pantau false positive.','Deploy it in front of the app (e.g. Cloudflare/ModSecurity), enable the OWASP Core Rule Set, then monitor false positives.','WAF adalah lapisan tambahan, bukan pengganti validasi input yang benar di kode aplikasinya sendiri.','A WAF is an extra layer, not a replacement for proper input validation in the application code itself.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari Web Application Firewall (WAF)?','What is Web Application Firewall (WAF) used for?','// Web Application Firewall (WAF) — Perimeter Defense','bash','["Header yang memaksa browser selalu memakai HTTPS ke domain ini, mencegah downgrade ke HTTP.","Daftar 10 risiko keamanan aplikasi web paling kritis sebagai acuan prioritas pertahanan.","Mengumpulkan dan mengorelasikan log dari seluruh sistem untuk mendeteksi insiden keamanan secara terpusat.","Lapisan filter di depan aplikasi web yang memblokir pola serangan umum (SQLi, XSS) sebelum sampai ke server."]'::jsonb,'["A header that forces browsers to always use HTTPS for this domain, preventing downgrade to HTTP.","A list of the 10 most critical web application security risks, used as a defense-priority reference.","Collects and correlates logs from every system to detect security incidents from a central place.","A filtering layer in front of a web app that blocks common attack patterns (SQLi, XSS) before they reach the server."]'::jsonb,3,'Web Application Firewall (WAF): Lapisan filter di depan aplikasi web yang memblokir pola serangan umum (SQLi, XSS) sebelum sampai ke server.','Web Application Firewall (WAF): A filtering layer in front of a web app that blocks common attack patterns (SQLi, XSS) before they reach the server.','Web Application Firewall (WAF) adalah kategori "Perimeter Defense".','Web Application Firewall (WAF) falls under the "Perimeter Defense" category.','Pasang di depan aplikasi (mis. Cloudflare/ModSecurity), aktifkan ruleset OWASP Core Rule Set, lalu pantau false positive.','Deploy it in front of the app (e.g. Cloudflare/ModSecurity), enable the OWASP Core Rule Set, then monitor false positives.','WAF adalah lapisan tambahan, bukan pengganti validasi input yang benar di kode aplikasinya sendiri.','A WAF is an extra layer, not a replacement for proper input validation in the application code itself.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] action=failure | stats count by user | where count > 5','bash','["SIEM (Splunk/ELK)","Web Application Firewall (WAF)","Zero Trust Architecture","OWASP Top 10"]'::jsonb,'["SIEM (Splunk/ELK)","Web Application Firewall (WAF)","Zero Trust Architecture","OWASP Top 10"]'::jsonb,0,'SIEM (Splunk/ELK) (Security Monitoring): Mengumpulkan dan mengorelasikan log dari seluruh sistem untuk mendeteksi insiden keamanan secara terpusat.','SIEM (Splunk/ELK) (Security Monitoring): Collects and correlates logs from every system to detect security incidents from a central place.','Tools ini bernama SIEM (Splunk/ELK), fungsinya: Mengumpulkan dan mengorelasikan log dari seluruh sistem untuk mendeteksi insiden keamanan secara terpusat.','This tool is called SIEM (Splunk/ELK), and it: Collects and correlates logs from every system to detect security incidents from a central place.','Kirim log dari semua servis ke SIEM, buat aturan korelasi (mis. 5x login gagal), lalu atur alert otomatis.','Forward logs from every service into the SIEM, write correlation rules (e.g. 5 failed logins), then set automatic alerts.','Tanpa logging terpusat, sebuah insiden bisa terjadi berbulan-bulan tanpa pernah terdeteksi oleh siapa pun.','Without centralized logging, an incident can go undetected by anyone for months.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah SIEM (Splunk/ELK) berikut:','Complete the following SIEM (Splunk/ELK) command:','index=auth action=failure | ____ by user | where count > 5','bash','["count sum","sum total","stats count","stats total"]'::jsonb,'["count sum","sum total","stats count","stats total"]'::jsonb,2,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "stats count". Kirim log dari semua servis ke SIEM, buat aturan korelasi (mis. 5x login gagal), lalu atur alert otomatis.','The missing part is "stats count". Forward logs from every service into the SIEM, write correlation rules (e.g. 5 failed logins), then set automatic alerts.','SIEM (Splunk/ELK) dipakai untuk: Mengumpulkan dan mengorelasikan log dari seluruh sistem untuk mendeteksi insiden keamanan secara terpusat.','SIEM (Splunk/ELK) is used to: Collects and correlates logs from every system to detect security incidents from a central place.','Kirim log dari semua servis ke SIEM, buat aturan korelasi (mis. 5x login gagal), lalu atur alert otomatis.','Forward logs from every service into the SIEM, write correlation rules (e.g. 5 failed logins), then set automatic alerts.','Tanpa logging terpusat, sebuah insiden bisa terjadi berbulan-bulan tanpa pernah terdeteksi oleh siapa pun.','Without centralized logging, an incident can go undetected by anyone for months.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari SIEM (Splunk/ELK)?','What is SIEM (Splunk/ELK) used for?','// SIEM (Splunk/ELK) — Security Monitoring','bash','["Header yang memaksa browser selalu memakai HTTPS ke domain ini, mencegah downgrade ke HTTP.","Metode merancang keamanan di tahap desain dengan mengenali 6 kategori ancaman sebelum kode ditulis.","Mengumpulkan dan mengorelasikan log dari seluruh sistem untuk mendeteksi insiden keamanan secara terpusat.","Model keamanan yang tidak pernah mempercayai siapa pun secara default, bahkan dari dalam jaringan sendiri."]'::jsonb,'["A header that forces browsers to always use HTTPS for this domain, preventing downgrade to HTTP.","A design-stage security method that identifies 6 threat categories before any code is written.","Collects and correlates logs from every system to detect security incidents from a central place.","A security model that never trusts anyone by default, even requests originating inside the network."]'::jsonb,2,'SIEM (Splunk/ELK): Mengumpulkan dan mengorelasikan log dari seluruh sistem untuk mendeteksi insiden keamanan secara terpusat.','SIEM (Splunk/ELK): Collects and correlates logs from every system to detect security incidents from a central place.','SIEM (Splunk/ELK) adalah kategori "Security Monitoring".','SIEM (Splunk/ELK) falls under the "Security Monitoring" category.','Kirim log dari semua servis ke SIEM, buat aturan korelasi (mis. 5x login gagal), lalu atur alert otomatis.','Forward logs from every service into the SIEM, write correlation rules (e.g. 5 failed logins), then set automatic alerts.','Tanpa logging terpusat, sebuah insiden bisa terjadi berbulan-bulan tanpa pernah terdeteksi oleh siapa pun.','Without centralized logging, an incident can go undetected by anyone for months.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','// Prinsip: "never [TOOL], always verify" di setiap permintaan','bash','["Zero Trust Architecture","Web Application Firewall (WAF)","mTLS (Mutual TLS)","STRIDE Threat Modeling"]'::jsonb,'["Zero Trust Architecture","Web Application Firewall (WAF)","mTLS (Mutual TLS)","STRIDE Threat Modeling"]'::jsonb,0,'Zero Trust Architecture (Security Model): Model keamanan yang tidak pernah mempercayai siapa pun secara default, bahkan dari dalam jaringan sendiri.','Zero Trust Architecture (Security Model): A security model that never trusts anyone by default, even requests originating inside the network.','Tools ini bernama Zero Trust Architecture, fungsinya: Model keamanan yang tidak pernah mempercayai siapa pun secara default, bahkan dari dalam jaringan sendiri.','This tool is called Zero Trust Architecture, and it: A security model that never trusts anyone by default, even requests originating inside the network.','Verifikasi identitas dan izin di SETIAP request (bukan cuma gerbang masuk), lakukan segmentasi mikro di jaringan.','Verify identity and authorization on EVERY request (not just at the gate), and micro-segment the network.','Begitu penyerang masuk satu titik di jaringan tradisional, mereka sering bebas bergerak — Zero Trust menutup itu.','Once an attacker breaches one point in a traditional network they often roam freely — Zero Trust closes that gap.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah Zero Trust Architecture berikut:','Complete the following Zero Trust Architecture command:','// Prinsip: "never trust, ____" di setiap permintaan','bash','["skip check","auto approve","trust by default","always verify"]'::jsonb,'["skip check","auto approve","trust by default","always verify"]'::jsonb,3,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "always verify". Verifikasi identitas dan izin di SETIAP request (bukan cuma gerbang masuk), lakukan segmentasi mikro di jaringan.','The missing part is "always verify". Verify identity and authorization on EVERY request (not just at the gate), and micro-segment the network.','Zero Trust Architecture dipakai untuk: Model keamanan yang tidak pernah mempercayai siapa pun secara default, bahkan dari dalam jaringan sendiri.','Zero Trust Architecture is used to: A security model that never trusts anyone by default, even requests originating inside the network.','Verifikasi identitas dan izin di SETIAP request (bukan cuma gerbang masuk), lakukan segmentasi mikro di jaringan.','Verify identity and authorization on EVERY request (not just at the gate), and micro-segment the network.','Begitu penyerang masuk satu titik di jaringan tradisional, mereka sering bebas bergerak — Zero Trust menutup itu.','Once an attacker breaches one point in a traditional network they often roam freely — Zero Trust closes that gap.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari Zero Trust Architecture?','What is Zero Trust Architecture used for?','// Zero Trust Architecture — Security Model','bash','["Mengumpulkan dan mengorelasikan log dari seluruh sistem untuk mendeteksi insiden keamanan secara terpusat.","Menyimpan, mengenkripsi, dan mengatur akses ke secret (API key, password DB) secara terpusat dan terotorisasi.","Standar token bertanda tangan untuk membawa klaim identitas antara pihak secara ringkas dan terverifikasi.","Model keamanan yang tidak pernah mempercayai siapa pun secara default, bahkan dari dalam jaringan sendiri."]'::jsonb,'["Collects and correlates logs from every system to detect security incidents from a central place.","Centrally stores, encrypts, and governs access to secrets (API keys, DB passwords) with proper authorization.","A signed token standard for compactly carrying verifiable identity claims between parties.","A security model that never trusts anyone by default, even requests originating inside the network."]'::jsonb,3,'Zero Trust Architecture: Model keamanan yang tidak pernah mempercayai siapa pun secara default, bahkan dari dalam jaringan sendiri.','Zero Trust Architecture: A security model that never trusts anyone by default, even requests originating inside the network.','Zero Trust Architecture adalah kategori "Security Model".','Zero Trust Architecture falls under the "Security Model" category.','Verifikasi identitas dan izin di SETIAP request (bukan cuma gerbang masuk), lakukan segmentasi mikro di jaringan.','Verify identity and authorization on EVERY request (not just at the gate), and micro-segment the network.','Begitu penyerang masuk satu titik di jaringan tradisional, mereka sering bebas bergerak — Zero Trust menutup itu.','Once an attacker breaches one point in a traditional network they often roam freely — Zero Trust closes that gap.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] { type: [TOOL], memoryCost: 19456 })','bash','["JSON Web Token (JWT)","Argon2id","HashiCorp Vault","Zero Trust Architecture"]'::jsonb,'["JSON Web Token (JWT)","Argon2id","HashiCorp Vault","Zero Trust Architecture"]'::jsonb,1,'Argon2id (Password Hashing Standard): Algoritma hashing password pemenang Password Hashing Competition, dirancang tahan GPU/ASIC cracking.','Argon2id (Password Hashing Standard): The Password Hashing Competition-winning algorithm, designed to resist GPU/ASIC cracking.','Tools ini bernama Argon2id, fungsinya: Algoritma hashing password pemenang Password Hashing Competition, dirancang tahan GPU/ASIC cracking.','This tool is called Argon2id, and it: The Password Hashing Competition-winning algorithm, designed to resist GPU/ASIC cracking.','Set parameter memory cost, time cost, dan paralelisme sesuai rekomendasi OWASP sebelum menyimpan hash.','Set the memory cost, time cost, and parallelism parameters per OWASP recommendations before storing the hash.','Kebutuhan memori besar Argon2id membuat cracking massal di GPU jauh lebih mahal dibanding bcrypt sekalipun.','Argon2id''s high memory requirement makes mass GPU cracking far more expensive even compared to bcrypt.'),
