('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari Argon2id?','What is Argon2id used for?','// Argon2id — Password Hashing Standard','bash','["Metode merancang keamanan di tahap desain dengan mengenali 6 kategori ancaman sebelum kode ditulis.","Standar OWASP berisi daftar kontrol terverifikasi untuk merancang dan menguji keamanan aplikasi dari awal.","Header HTTP yang membatasi sumber mana saja yang boleh memuat script/style di sebuah halaman.","Algoritma hashing password pemenang Password Hashing Competition, dirancang tahan GPU/ASIC cracking."]'::jsonb,'["A design-stage security method that identifies 6 threat categories before any code is written.","OWASP''s standard list of verifiable controls for designing and testing application security from the ground up.","An HTTP header that restricts which sources are allowed to load scripts/styles on a page.","The Password Hashing Competition-winning algorithm, designed to resist GPU/ASIC cracking."]'::jsonb,3,'Argon2id: Algoritma hashing password pemenang Password Hashing Competition, dirancang tahan GPU/ASIC cracking.','Argon2id: The Password Hashing Competition-winning algorithm, designed to resist GPU/ASIC cracking.','Argon2id adalah kategori "Password Hashing Standard".','Argon2id falls under the "Password Hashing Standard" category.','Set parameter memory cost, time cost, dan paralelisme sesuai rekomendasi OWASP sebelum menyimpan hash.','Set the memory cost, time cost, and parallelism parameters per OWASP recommendations before storing the hash.','Kebutuhan memori besar Argon2id membuat cracking massal di GPU jauh lebih mahal dibanding bcrypt sekalipun.','Argon2id''s high memory requirement makes mass GPU cracking far more expensive even compared to bcrypt.'),
