ssl_client_certificate ca.pem;','bash','["mTLS (Mutual TLS)","Argon2id","Content Security Policy (CSP)","OWASP Top 10"]'::jsonb,'["mTLS (Mutual TLS)","Argon2id","Content Security Policy (CSP)","OWASP Top 10"]'::jsonb,0,'mTLS (Mutual TLS) (Service-to-Service Auth): Kedua pihak (klien dan server) saling memverifikasi sertifikat, bukan cuma server ke klien seperti TLS biasa.','mTLS (Mutual TLS) (Service-to-Service Auth): Both sides (client and server) verify each other''s certificates, unlike regular TLS where only the client verifies the server.','Tools ini bernama mTLS (Mutual TLS), fungsinya: Kedua pihak (klien dan server) saling memverifikasi sertifikat, bukan cuma server ke klien seperti TLS biasa.','This tool is called mTLS (Mutual TLS), and it: Both sides (client and server) verify each other''s certificates, unlike regular TLS where only the client verifies the server.','Terbitkan sertifikat untuk tiap servis internal, lalu wajibkan verifikasi sertifikat klien di setiap koneksi antar servis.','Issue a certificate for each internal service, then require client certificate verification on every service-to-service connection.','Di arsitektur microservice, mTLS mencegah servis palsu menyamar sebagai servis internal yang sah.','In a microservice architecture, mTLS prevents a rogue service from impersonating a legitimate internal one.'),
