('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari mTLS (Mutual TLS)?','What is mTLS (Mutual TLS) used for?','// mTLS (Mutual TLS) — Service-to-Service Auth','bash','["Header HTTP yang membatasi sumber mana saja yang boleh memuat script/style di sebuah halaman.","Kedua pihak (klien dan server) saling memverifikasi sertifikat, bukan cuma server ke klien seperti TLS biasa.","Menyimpan, mengenkripsi, dan mengatur akses ke secret (API key, password DB) secara terpusat dan terotorisasi.","Algoritma hashing password pemenang Password Hashing Competition, dirancang tahan GPU/ASIC cracking."]'::jsonb,'["An HTTP header that restricts which sources are allowed to load scripts/styles on a page.","Both sides (client and server) verify each other''s certificates, unlike regular TLS where only the client verifies the server.","Centrally stores, encrypts, and governs access to secrets (API keys, DB passwords) with proper authorization.","The Password Hashing Competition-winning algorithm, designed to resist GPU/ASIC cracking."]'::jsonb,1,'mTLS (Mutual TLS): Kedua pihak (klien dan server) saling memverifikasi sertifikat, bukan cuma server ke klien seperti TLS biasa.','mTLS (Mutual TLS): Both sides (client and server) verify each other''s certificates, unlike regular TLS where only the client verifies the server.','mTLS (Mutual TLS) adalah kategori "Service-to-Service Auth".','mTLS (Mutual TLS) falls under the "Service-to-Service Auth" category.','Terbitkan sertifikat untuk tiap servis internal, lalu wajibkan verifikasi sertifikat klien di setiap koneksi antar servis.','Issue a certificate for each internal service, then require client certificate verification on every service-to-service connection.','Di arsitektur microservice, mTLS mencegah servis palsu menyamar sebagai servis internal yang sah.','In a microservice architecture, mTLS prevents a rogue service from impersonating a legitimate internal one.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','// S-T-R-I-D-E: Spoofing, Tampering, Repudiation, Info Disclosure, DoS, Elevation of Privilege','bash','["Content Security Policy (CSP)","STRIDE Threat Modeling","Zero Trust Architecture","Argon2id"]'::jsonb,'["Content Security Policy (CSP)","STRIDE Threat Modeling","Zero Trust Architecture","Argon2id"]'::jsonb,1,'STRIDE Threat Modeling (Security Design Method): Metode merancang keamanan di tahap desain dengan mengenali 6 kategori ancaman sebelum kode ditulis.','STRIDE Threat Modeling (Security Design Method): A design-stage security method that identifies 6 threat categories before any code is written.','Tools ini bernama STRIDE Threat Modeling, fungsinya: Metode merancang keamanan di tahap desain dengan mengenali 6 kategori ancaman sebelum kode ditulis.','This tool is called STRIDE Threat Modeling, and it: A design-stage security method that identifies 6 threat categories before any code is written.','Gambar diagram arsitektur, lalu untuk tiap komponen tanyakan: bisakah ia Spoofed, Tampered, Repudiated, dst.','Draw the architecture diagram, then for each component ask: can it be Spoofed, Tampered, Repudiated, etc.','Menemukan ancaman di atas kertas (desain) jauh lebih murah daripada menemukannya lewat insiden produksi.','Finding threats on paper (at design time) is far cheaper than finding them through a production incident.'),
('primordial_god','fill','Lengkapi perintah STRIDE Threat Modeling berikut:','Complete the following STRIDE Threat Modeling command:','// S-T-R-I-D-E: Spoofing, Tampering, ____, Info Disclosure, DoS, Elevation of Privilege','bash','["Replication","Repudiation","Restriction","Redirection"]'::jsonb,'["Replication","Repudiation","Restriction","Redirection"]'::jsonb,1,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "Repudiation". Gambar diagram arsitektur, lalu untuk tiap komponen tanyakan: bisakah ia Spoofed, Tampered, Repudiated, dst.','The missing part is "Repudiation". Draw the architecture diagram, then for each component ask: can it be Spoofed, Tampered, Repudiated, etc.','STRIDE Threat Modeling dipakai untuk: Metode merancang keamanan di tahap desain dengan mengenali 6 kategori ancaman sebelum kode ditulis.','STRIDE Threat Modeling is used to: A design-stage security method that identifies 6 threat categories before any code is written.','Gambar diagram arsitektur, lalu untuk tiap komponen tanyakan: bisakah ia Spoofed, Tampered, Repudiated, dst.','Draw the architecture diagram, then for each component ask: can it be Spoofed, Tampered, Repudiated, etc.','Menemukan ancaman di atas kertas (desain) jauh lebih murah daripada menemukannya lewat insiden produksi.','Finding threats on paper (at design time) is far cheaper than finding them through a production incident.'),
('primordial_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari STRIDE Threat Modeling?','What is STRIDE Threat Modeling used for?','// STRIDE Threat Modeling — Security Design Method','bash','["Metode merancang keamanan di tahap desain dengan mengenali 6 kategori ancaman sebelum kode ditulis.","Protokol standar untuk otorisasi delegasi (OAuth) dan autentikasi identitas (OIDC) antar aplikasi.","Mengumpulkan dan mengorelasikan log dari seluruh sistem untuk mendeteksi insiden keamanan secara terpusat.","Header HTTP yang membatasi sumber mana saja yang boleh memuat script/style di sebuah halaman."]'::jsonb,'["A design-stage security method that identifies 6 threat categories before any code is written.","The standard protocol for delegated authorization (OAuth) and identity authentication (OIDC) between apps.","Collects and correlates logs from every system to detect security incidents from a central place.","An HTTP header that restricts which sources are allowed to load scripts/styles on a page."]'::jsonb,0,'STRIDE Threat Modeling: Metode merancang keamanan di tahap desain dengan mengenali 6 kategori ancaman sebelum kode ditulis.','STRIDE Threat Modeling: A design-stage security method that identifies 6 threat categories before any code is written.','STRIDE Threat Modeling adalah kategori "Security Design Method".','STRIDE Threat Modeling falls under the "Security Design Method" category.','Gambar diagram arsitektur, lalu untuk tiap komponen tanyakan: bisakah ia Spoofed, Tampered, Repudiated, dst.','Draw the architecture diagram, then for each component ask: can it be Spoofed, Tampered, Repudiated, etc.','Menemukan ancaman di atas kertas (desain) jauh lebih murah daripada menemukannya lewat insiden produksi.','Finding threats on paper (at design time) is far cheaper than finding them through a production incident.');
